# Collected prospect data.
#
# Every fact in here is individually public. The aggregate is not: a prospect
# file carries an owner name, a direct phone and an address, and for a sole
# proprietor those last two are routinely a personal cell and a home address.
# Review quotes add named third parties who have no relationship to this
# project. That is a targeting list plus personal data about private
# individuals, and git history makes it permanent, so it stays out.
#
# raw.json is out for a second reason: it is the verbatim Places API response,
# and Google's terms restrict storing Places content. It is also the cheapest
# thing here to lose, since `htpfinder collect` regenerates it.
data/

# Generated demo sites. Built from a prospect, so same data, one step removed.
demos/src/data/
demos/dist/

# The control panel's build output. Regenerated by `cd ui && npm run build`.
ui/dist/

# Screenshots from responsive checks.
.shots/
.playwright-mcp/

# Secrets. GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY belongs in the environment, never in a file.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules/
dist/
*.local
.DS_Store
